[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2640.309, "timestamp": "00:44:00", "text": "知ってるよ、私は、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2642.23, "timestamp": "00:44:02", "text": "ずっとやりたかったんだけど、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2644.47, "timestamp": "00:44:04", "text": "緊張しているけど、とても嬉しい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2646.43, "timestamp": "00:44:06", "text": "今、ここにいます。でも、私はただ言いたいだけです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2650.23, "timestamp": "00:44:10", "text": "コラボする前に言ったように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2651.99, "timestamp": "00:44:11", "text": "あなたの耳が無事であることを願っています"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2652.022, "timestamp": "00:44:12", "author": "@notpravinlol", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/t9UXLD6AmzS1-YItB_6_Kz4uAutM3H0oNxaU47_WUxq4oWNpbcDQvZiftO3UE0nS_-jgazDe=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hey pratham and vinzi"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2653.43, "timestamp": "00:44:13", "text": "あなたが言ったように、できないからです"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2653.685, "timestamp": "00:44:13", "author": "@KonztellionHelper", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/GocLQxiJeUhcpFBwOECdYbCqbqHlCvz1B8j2gnfHQ1Q3AM1kFQ-eKqoi6TpMpyuxId3-6U94bcI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Greetings Konzteller! notpravin~🌟 Welcome to the Guild! Make sure to read the Guildmate Guidelines in the description below before chatting further. Enjoy your stay!"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2655.99, "timestamp": "00:44:15", "text": "鋭い音を聞くように、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2657.91, "timestamp": "00:44:17", "text": "問題は、実際に聞くことができない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2660.79, "timestamp": "00:44:20", "text": "鋭い音そのもののようなもの。でもその後あなたは"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2661.674, "timestamp": "00:44:21", "author": "@prathampro", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/7tcieem4yOUd9YXALarR3aYDlD62vnZzUlT_1QVJKtQgVzXDOl8byGd1-8hfYZmHnjbZGyS_5Uw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "sup pravin"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2662.55, "timestamp": "00:44:22", "text": "最も柔らかな声の持ち主の一人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2664.63, "timestamp": "00:44:24", "text": "私が今まで聞いた中で。だから、私が言ったように、もし"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2666.79, "timestamp": "00:44:26", "text": "もしあなたの声があなたの声がこんな感じだったら"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2668.55, "timestamp": "00:44:28", "text": "ナイフはプラスチック製のもののようなもの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2670.95, "timestamp": "00:44:30", "text": "ケーキナイフ、バターナイフですらない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2673.27, "timestamp": "00:44:33", "text": "ナイフ、バターナイフですらない、私が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2677.67, "timestamp": "00:44:37", "text": "それすらもくれないだろう。何てことだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2680.23, "timestamp": "00:44:40", "text": "すべて順調です。すべて順調です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2682.87, "timestamp": "00:44:42", "text": "私はあなたが見てくれるのを感謝しています"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2685.4, "timestamp": "00:44:45", "text": "外を見ている。本当にそうなんです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2687.109, "timestamp": "00:44:47", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2689.829, "timestamp": "00:44:49", "text": "ええ、すべてがうまくいかなかったらちょっと心配でした"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2692.23, "timestamp": "00:44:52", "text": "大丈夫でしょう。私は好きになりたくなかった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2695.03, "timestamp": "00:44:55", "text": "マイクに向かって叫び、そして私が下げたように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2698.069, "timestamp": "00:44:58", "text": "少し感度を上げて。"}]